{"unit_id":"megablue__dsh-feature-map#card-zh","repo":"megablue/dsh-feature-map","commit":"43f10134ec413fd6ebe03c35306452436d92bd20","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-feature-map 是一款面向 DSH agent 的项目文档导航插件。它注册功能地图查询、检查、采用、初始化和再生成工具，并在提示中引导先看地图再读源码；配置为 enforce 时，还会拦截一次未查地图的源码读取。用户可按主题定位功能页和小节、检查索引与页面漂移、为新项目生成文档骨架，或整理过长的地图。适合希望让编码 agent 快速找到项目设计和实现说明的开发者。无需 API 密钥或外部账号，文档读取和写入使用本地项目及 DSH 文件接口。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:489-586","lib/index.js:931-1033","lib/index.js:1141-1168"]}
{"unit_id":"megablue__dsh-feature-map#card-en","repo":"megablue/dsh-feature-map","commit":"43f10134ec413fd6ebe03c35306452436d92bd20","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-feature-map guides DSH agents to consult a project feature map before source. Its tools query topics, check index drift, scaffold documentation, and regenerate oversized maps. Enforce mode can block one source lookup until consultation. No API key or external account is needed; files are local.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:489-586","lib/index.js:931-1033","lib/index.js:1141-1168"]}
