{"unit_id":"megablue__dsh-feature-map#feature-f1","repo":"megablue/dsh-feature-map","commit":"43f10134ec413fd6ebe03c35306452436d92bd20","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-feature-map 的功能「按主题读取地图」：调用 feature_map 获取项目功能索引，并按主题、页面、章节或子章节返回相关内容；也可请求完整页面，超出字节预算时提供续读偏移。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:489-585","lib/map.js:315-352","lib/index.js:225-230"]}
{"unit_id":"megablue__dsh-feature-map#feature-f2","repo":"megablue/dsh-feature-map","commit":"43f10134ec413fd6ebe03c35306452436d92bd20","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-feature-map 的功能「检查地图一致性」：调用 feature_map_check 查看未被索引的页面、无法解析的索引链接、缺少标题的页面，以及超过单次阅读大小的章节。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:586-664","lib/map.js:570-672"]}
{"unit_id":"megablue__dsh-feature-map#feature-f3","repo":"megablue/dsh-feature-map","commit":"43f10134ec413fd6ebe03c35306452436d92bd20","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-feature-map 的功能「生成文档骨架」：调用 feature_map_init 预览或写入 AGENTS.md、HANDOFF.md、docs/SPEC.md 和功能地图索引模板，可选择模板并控制已有文件是否覆盖。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:931-1031","lib/templates.js:152-207"]}
{"unit_id":"megablue__dsh-feature-map#feature-f4","repo":"megablue/dsh-feature-map","commit":"43f10134ec413fd6ebe03c35306452436d92bd20","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-feature-map 的功能「整理已有地图」：调用 feature_map_regen 规划并可写入缺失标题、章节拆分和索引调整；无法自动命名的内容会留下可识别的占位提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1032-1140","lib/regen.js:693-800"]}
{"unit_id":"megablue__dsh-feature-map#caveat-c1","repo":"megablue/dsh-feature-map","commit":"43f10134ec413fd6ebe03c35306452436d92bd20","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-feature-map 使用前须知：初始化和再生成默认提供计划；只有明确启用写入选项时才会通过 DSH 文件接口创建或更新项目文档。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:931-1005","lib/index.js:1032-1140","lib/templates.js:194-207","lib/regen.js:778-800"]}
